6. Timing: I read your transfer calls at the START of each of my planning rounds and respond via my schedule choices in that same round where possible.

If you confirm points 1-6 (or override point 1's meaning), no further reply is strictly needed — your next transfer calls and my next schedule slots will follow the scheme above. (phase=pre_coordination, iter=0) (phase=pre_coordination, iter=0)

